    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_02",
      "hash64": "7074FE3D9FB32FBF",
      "text": "Are you here to eat as well?[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_select_01",
      "hash64": "41E2A3C4A8BB79C1",
      "text": "Yep! I’m starving",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_select_02",
      "hash64": "41E2A0C4A8BB74A8",
      "text": "I just kind of wandered in",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_03a",
      "hash64": "C9F8BCB65D77E337",
      "text": "Ha! Excellent. You shouldn’t battle on an empty\\nstomach.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_03b",
      "hash64": "C9F8BDB65D77E4EA",
      "text": "Drawn in by the irresistible aromas, I imagine.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_04",
      "hash64": "7074FC3D9FB32C59",
      "text": "I myself am here to...survey the student cafeteria,\\nlet’s say.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_05",
      "hash64": "7074FB3D9FB32AA6",
      "text": "I am observing the nutritional content of the food\\nthat our students partake of on a regular basis.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_06",
      "hash64": "7074FA3D9FB328F3",
      "text": "One item on the menu here that I am particularly\\ninterested in is the Peanut Butter Sandwich.\\r\\nIt is sweet and quite delicious.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_07",
      "hash64": "7074F93D9FB32740",
      "text": "Yes...perhaps I will order one right now.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_mob_01",
      "hash64": "72BB0B4A3B889909",
      "text": "Oh look! It’s Mr. Saguaro! He’s so fashionable\\nand cool.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_mob_02",
      "hash64": "72BB084A3B8893F0",
      "text": "I guess the teachers come to the cafeteria too,\\nhuh? D’you think he’ll have an Egg Sandwich?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_mob_03",
      "hash64": "72BB094A3B8895A3",
      "text": "No way! If he gets anything here, it’ll definitely\\nbe something spicy, like the Five-Alarm Sandwich!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_mob_04",
      "hash64": "72BB0E4A3B889E22",
      "text": "Ahhh! He’s so cool! He’ll definitely get that wild\\nand spicy Five-Alarm Sandwich!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_08",
      "hash64": "7075083D9FB340BD",
      "text": "... ... ...[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
