    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_select_03",
      "hash64": "41E2A1C4A8BB765B",
      "text": "But, Mr. Saguaro! What about...?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_select_04",
      "hash64": "41E2A6C4A8BB7EDA",
      "text": "No! Have a Peanut Butter Sandwich!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_10",
      "hash64": "7071FA3D9FB0F31C",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]A-ah, yes. You suggested I have a Peanut Butter\\nSandwich,\\r\\nM[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0305)]asteriss\\r\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]?\\r\\nI\\r\\nsuppose\\r\\nI\\r\\nshall\\r\\nhave\\r\\nto\\r\\ntry\\r\\none.\\r\\nIf\\r\\nyou insist.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
