    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_13",
      "hash64": "7071FD3D9FB0F835",
      "text": "It seems that the students tend to view me as\\nfashionable and cool...or even—dare I say it?—\\r\\nexuding a sort of brooding strength.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_14",
      "hash64": "7071F63D9FB0EC50",
      "text": "I have a habit of acting in such a way so as not to\\ndestroy their image of me.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_15",
      "hash64": "7071F73D9FB0EE03",
      "text": "I showed my true colors to you just now without\\nthinking. Please keep this as a secret between us.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
